                  "type": "heading",
                  "level": 1,
                  "html": "Logged Universe #3",
                  "align": "center",
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "In 2021, humanity unearthed a strange artefact. Dated to a few millions years ago, it revealed countless logs of a future humanity that was recorded into software that resembled a modern day blockchain. Uncertain of whether the artefact was prophecy, technologists and writers have been decoding the stories hidden within.",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "These are the stories and artefacts of the Logged Universe.",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "<strong>Season 1 - Genesis.</strong>",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "6 short stories, 6 NFT collections.",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "<strong>Little Martians and the Human Memorial Monument is the 3rd collection from the Logged Universe series</strong>",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "<a href=\"https://www.untitledfrontier.studio/blog/logged-universe-3-little-martians-amp-the-human-memorial-monument\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Read the story here!</strong></a>",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "Published by <a href=\"https://www.untitledfrontier.studio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Untitled Frontier</a>",
